SUMMARY:[Instagram (Reel)] Talking to camera: "Example painting 4"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 4 (stage finished\, drop 2026-10-24\, pr
 ints)\nWHY: This is what builds a fan base. People buy from a person they 
 feel they know. One idea per video: why this painting\, what you learned\,
  an answer to a comment.\nSHOT: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the pa
 inting behind you / 30-90s for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / St
 art mid-thought\, no intro\nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example:
  'Why I painted this twice'.\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting the
 y would hang.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 
 90s\, hook in the first second\, captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, r
 aw is fine.\nTIME: about 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.
 io/anna-studio/
