SUMMARY:[Threads] Work for sale: "Example painting 2"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 2 (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: Say it i
 s for sale\, plainly\, with a price. Most people never buy because they we
 re never asked. Every listed painting gets this post\, more than once.\nSH
 OT: The piece in a room for scale / The piece straight on\nCAPTION: Title\
 , size\, price\, shipping\, how to buy. One line about it. That is all.\nA
 SK: DM me / link in bio. Say which.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 char
 s\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alone
 . Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 10 
 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
