SUMMARY:[Instagram (Story)] Studio shot
DESCRIPTION:WHY: People follow a person\, not a catalog. The studio\, the w
 all of work\, the mess\, the mistakes.\nSHOT: Wide shot of the studio / Wo
 rk leaning against the wall / Hands\, brushes\, palette\, the floor\nCAPTI
 ON: Something true about being a painter today. Short.\nASK: None needed. 
 Or a question.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to
  90s\, hook in the first second\, captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, 
 raw is fine.\nTIME: about 5 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.
 io/anna-studio/
