SUMMARY:[YouTube (Short)] Painting video: "Example painting 4"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 4 (stage finished\, drop 2026-10-24\, pr
 ints)\nWHY: Reach. Video of the painting being made\, or a slow pan over t
 he finished surface\, is how strangers find the work. Record once\, post t
 o four platforms.\nSHOT: Phone on a tripod\, 9:16\, over the shoulder or s
 traight on / 10-20 min of real painting cut to the best 20-45s / Or: slow 
 pan across the finished painting\, ending on a pull-back of the whole thin
 g\nCAPTION: On-screen text or voiceover: what you were thinking during thi
 s part. Keep it human.\nASK: Follow to see it finished / link to buy.\nFOR
 MAT (YouTube): Shorts 9:16 under 60s\, same as TikTok. Talking videos 2-6 
 min\, 16:9 or 9:16\, phone at eye level\, window light\, title says what y
 ou talk about.\nTIME: about 30 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.gith
 ub.io/anna-studio/
