SUMMARY:[Threads] The story behind it: "Example painting 5"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 5 (stage finished)\nWHY: The why. This i
 s the post that turns a liker into a buyer. Text does the work\, the image
  just needs to be there.\nSHOT: The finished piece\, or a detail of it\nCA
 PTION: Where the idea came from\, what happened while making it\, what it 
 means now. 3-6 sentences. Honest beats clever.\nASK: If this one speaks to
  you\, it is available. Link.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-
 10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alone. Post
  the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 15 min\n\
