DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 1 (stage sold\, prints)\nWHY: This is wh
 at builds a fan base. People buy from a person they feel they know. One id
 ea per video: why this painting\, what you learned\, an answer to a commen
 t.\nSHOT: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the painting behind you / 30
 -90s for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no i
 ntro\nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this t
 wice'.\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMAT 
 (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the firs
 t second\, captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: abo
 ut 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
