 ds a fan base. People buy from a person they feel they know. One idea per 
 video: why this painting\, what you learned\, an answer to a comment.\nSHO
 T: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the painting behind you / 30-90s fo
 r Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no intro\nC
 APTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this twice'.\
 nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMAT (Facebo
 ok): Same image or video as Instagram. Longer captions are fine here\, peo
 ple read. Always put the price and how to buy in the post.\nTIME: about 40
  min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
