 inting behind you / 30-90s for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / St
 art mid-thought\, no intro\nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example:
  'Why I painted this twice'.\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting the
 y would hang.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 
