 SHOT: The print in a frame on a real wall / Hands holding the print / Clos
 e-up of the paper texture\nCAPTION: Prints of [title] are up. Sizes. Paper
 . How many\, if limited.\nASK: Link to the shop.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text u
 p to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that
  stands alone. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTI
 ME: about 15 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
