SUMMARY:[Instagram (Reel)] Talking to camera: "Example painting 2"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 2 (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: This is 
 what builds a fan base. People buy from a person they feel they know. One 
 idea per video: why this painting\, what you learned\, an answer to a comm
 ent.\nSHOT: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the painting behind you / 
 30-90s for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no
  intro\nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this
  twice'.\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMA
 T (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the fi
 rst second\, captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: a
 bout 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Instagram,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
