 for Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no intro\
 nCAPTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this twice'
 .\nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMAT (Face
 book): Same image or video as Instagram. Longer captions are fine here\, p
 eople read. Always put the price and how to buy in the post.\nTIME: about 
 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
