SUMMARY:[Threads] Finished work: "Example painting 2"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 2 (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: The payo
 ff post. Shoot it properly. This image gets reused for the for-sale post\,
  the prints\, the newsletter\, the video.\nSHOT: Straight on\, even daylig
 ht\, no glare\, cropped to the edges / One shot in a room or leaning on a 
 wall for scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, medium. One lin
 e about what it ended up being about. Whether it is available.\nASK: DM to
  collect / link in bio / prints coming.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 
 chars\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands a
 lone. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about
  20 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
