 oom or leaning on a wall for scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, si
 ze\, medium. One line about what it ended up being about. Whether it is av
 ailable.\nASK: DM to collect / link in bio / prints coming.\nFORMAT (Insta
 gram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the first seco
 nd\, captions on. Stories daily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: about 20 
