 iece in a room for scale / The piece straight on\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, 
 price\, shipping\, how to buy. One line about it. That is all.\nASK: DM me
  / link in bio. Say which.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350). Reel
 s 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the first second\, captions on. Stories daily\,
  15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: about 10 min\n\nOpen the app: https://bria
 nolek.github.io/anna-studio/
