SUMMARY:[Instagram (Feed)] Finished work: "Example painting 5"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 5 (stage finished)\nWHY: The payoff post
 . Shoot it properly. This image gets reused for the for-sale post\, the pr
 ints\, the newsletter\, the video.\nSHOT: Straight on\, even daylight\, no
  glare\, cropped to the edges / One shot in a room or leaning on a wall fo
 r scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, medium. One line about
  what it ended up being about. Whether it is available.\nASK: DM to collec
 t / link in bio / prints coming.\nFORMAT (Instagram): Feed 4:5 (1080x1350)
 . Reels 9:16 up to 90s\, hook in the first second\, captions on. Stories d
 aily\, 15s each\, raw is fine.\nTIME: about 20 min\n\nOpen the app: https:
 //brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
CATEGORIES:Instagram,post
URL:https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
