SUMMARY:[Threads] Sold / collector: "Example painting 1"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 1 (stage sold\, prints)\nWHY: Social pro
 of. Every sale is a post. The packed box\, the piece on the collector's wa
 ll\, the thank you.\nSHOT: The packed order with the label / Collector's p
 hoto of it hung (ask for one) / The empty spot on the studio wall\nCAPTION
 : This one went to [city]. Thank you. One line about what it meant.\nASK: 
 Mention what is still available\, lightly.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 5
 00 chars\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stand
 s alone. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: ab
 out 10 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
