SUMMARY:[YouTube (Talking video)] Talking to camera: "Example painting 3"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example painting 3 (stage listed)\nWHY: This is what buil
 ds a fan base. People buy from a person they feel they know. One idea per 
 video: why this painting\, what you learned\, an answer to a comment.\nSHO
 T: Phone at eye level\, window light\, the painting behind you / 30-90s fo
 r Shorts/TikTok\, or 2-6 min for YouTube / Start mid-thought\, no intro\nC
 APTION: The one idea\, as the title. Example: 'Why I painted this twice'.\
 nASK: Ask them to tell you which painting they would hang.\nFORMAT (YouTub
 e): Shorts 9:16 under 60s\, same as TikTok. Talking videos 2-6 min\, 16:9 
 or 9:16\, phone at eye level\, window light\, title says what you talk abo
 ut.\nTIME: about 40 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-
 studio/
