 e image just needs to be there.\nSHOT: The finished piece\, or a detail of
  it\nCAPTION: Where the idea came from\, what happened while making it\, w
 hat it means now. 3-6 sentences. Honest beats clever.\nASK: If this one sp
 eaks to you\, it is available. Link.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 cha
 rs\, 1-10 images\, or video under 5 min. Lead with a line that stands alon
 e. Post the image\, say one true thing\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 15
  min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.github.io/anna-studio/
